==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Grubbin|16}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Grubbin|18}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*'''Gnaw''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Pikachu|58}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

